WEBVTT

00:31.390 --> 00:35.613
The sky wakes up when the sun goes down.

00:38.848 --> 00:42.989
A million electric eyes over the town.

00:45.690 --> 00:52.812
Turn the key and feel the hum in the floor. We're

00:52.852 --> 00:57.053
leaving the shadows right outside the door.

00:57.073 --> 01:03.494
Catch the neon pulse riding on the wire.

01:07.145 --> 01:12.229
Racing through the streets. Blowing like a

01:12.329 --> 01:17.973
fire. No looking back. We're out of frame.

01:18.454 --> 01:23.918
Running on the spark. Wild and untamed. Catch

01:23.938 --> 01:27.540
the neon pulse tonight.

01:34.537 --> 01:35.098
The End

01:45.129 --> 01:48.931
The dashboard is glowing, a steady bright

01:49.011 --> 01:50.432
green.

01:52.473 --> 01:59.057
The fastest escape that this city has seen. The

01:59.117 --> 02:03.339
rhythm is beating

02:03.499 --> 02:08.462
right under our feet. A steady transmission.

02:10.201 --> 02:17.972
Out on the street Catch the neon pulse Riding on

02:17.992 --> 02:23.545
the wire Racing through the streets Glowing

02:23.705 --> 02:31.389
like a fire No looking back We're out of the frame

02:31.929 --> 02:37.592
Burning on the spark Wild and untamed Catch the

02:37.672 --> 02:40.654
neon pulse tonight

02:45.237 --> 02:45.337
Hey.

03:17.323 --> 03:21.806
Through the tunnel of lights, blinding and fast

03:25.249 --> 03:28.571
Everything broken is left in the past

03:31.974 --> 03:36.157
Hold on to the wheel, steady and sure

03:38.539 --> 03:43.022
We're chasing a frequency, perfect and pure

04:05.103 --> 04:07.925
Catch

04:13.729 --> 04:21.714
the neon pulse Riding on the wire Racing through

04:21.754 --> 04:29.718
the streets Glowing like a fire No looking back

04:29.738 --> 04:34.443
We're out of the frame Running on the spark Wild

04:34.523 --> 04:41.890
and untamed Catch the neon pulse tonight

04:44.652 --> 04:48.977
Wild and untamed

04:50.058 --> 04:51.479
Catch the pulse tonight

